## How to drive E10 (operator notes)
- Fire designer: POST /api/episodes/{EP}/trigger {agentCode:'EXEC-EREF-DESIGNER',reason,payload:{shotId}}
  with Bearer EXEC_DIR_AI_TOKEN (in webapp/.env.local). Mode 4 auto-chains designer→EPREV→artist→anchor.
- Fire/regen one anchor from an APPROVED plan: POST /api/episodes/{EP}/regenerate-image-from-plan
  {shotId,planAssetId,reason}.
- If a plan is stuck REVISION on a COSMETIC EPREV revise: it's safe to promote SPC-ref_plan→APPROVED
  then fire execute-from-plan (verify the REVISE reasons are non-visual JSON first).
- Inspect anchors: assets where file_type LIKE 'IMG-anchor%', read metadata.identity_character_slugs
  / object_slugs / visual_review / shot_reference + drive_web_view_url.
- Server: dev (turbopack) hot-reloads code; DON'T edit files mid-generation (re-sync interrupts
  in-flight Inngest fns). bash cwd resets to /c/SandyStudio after git commit → `cd /c/SandyStudio/webapp`
  before npx/npm; git add paths are webapp/-prefixed from root.
- PLAN.md `Mode:` line is the mode-validator hook's source of truth — keep synced with Director's
  ===N=== (currently ===5===). After /clear it resets to ===1===; ask for ===5=== before code/DB writes.
- tmp diagnostic script pattern: read .env.local (relative), createClient with SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY.
